      "writtenOn": "2025-07-11T22:08:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When the AQ is turned on, there are cases where some blocks can in theory be lossless whereas others are not. In this case, the enable_chroma_deltaq can be 1, but based on whether the block is coded in lossless mode, it shall be enabled / disabled accordingly.\n\nSince all the block operations will go through this function initially to set the quantizer, this is probably the right place to conduct such checks.",
